  "第一章导览导读：水怎么来到呼吉尔诺尔": "Chapter One introduction: How does water reach Hujiernuoer?",
  "本段可辨线段；圆点标出当前观察位置。": "Visible segment; the dot marks your current viewpoint.",
  "同屏回看中桥、03 道路、东部泥沼、东池与西长湖候选；南侧分区从下一站起显示。": "The bridge, Road 03, East Marsh, East Pond and West Changhu are shown together. Southern catchments appear at the next stop.",
  "合看已讲过的水路和主湖分区，不代表实测分流。": "Previously discussed routes and catchments appear together. This does not establish a measured diversion.",
  "灰蓝面：两处桥西候选上游范围；桥口接续按原证据分段。": "Gray-blue areas: two possible upstream areas west of the bridge. The approaches remain separate where evidence is missing.",
  "白色点线：落在 E18 内的沟段。主湖 E18 原边界和面积保留。": "White dots: channel segments inside E18. The original E18 boundary and area are unchanged.",
  "这一站只显示泥沼低地；下一站再显示东池。": "This stop highlights the marsh lowland. The East Pond appears at the next stop.",
  "泥沼低地与东池分别显示；没有把中间缺口补成通水线。": "The marsh and pond are shown separately. The intervening gap is not drawn as a waterway.",
  "第 1 点 · 双侧圆涵连通": "Site 01 · Round culvert connects both sides",
  "第 2 点 · 南侧有涵 · 北侧疑似填埋": "Site 02 · South opening present · North side possibly filled",
  "第 3 点 · 双侧涵洞连通": "Site 03 · Culvert connects both sides",
  "第 4 点 · 路南沟渠汇入低点后下流": "Site 04 · South-side ditches converge and continue downhill",
  "现场记录：道路两侧有圆形涵洞并相互连通。": "Field record: the round culvert connects both sides of the road.",
  "现场记录：道路南侧有涵洞。北侧疑似填埋，尚未确认是否填埋及当前是否贯通。 记录者在 Google Earth 页脚显示 2009-09-05 的卫星图上沿蓝线辨读，提出旧低带可能经过第 2 点，后来可能改为由第 3 点过路。这是历史判读线索，尚未证实改线、改线时间或过水方向。": "Field record: there is a culvert on the south side. The north side may have been filled; neither the fill nor a current connection has been confirmed. In the Google Earth image labeled 5 September 2009, the field observer traced a possible earlier route through site 02, later possibly shifted to site 03. This does not establish that it changed, when, or in which direction water flowed.",
  "现场记录：道路两侧涵洞相互连通。 记录者在 Google Earth 页脚显示 2009-09-05 的卫星图上沿蓝线辨读，提出旧低带可能经过第 2 点，后来可能改为由第 3 点过路。这是历史判读线索，尚未证实改线、改线时间或过水方向。": "Field record: a culvert connects both sides. In the Google Earth image labeled 5 September 2009, the field observer traced a possible earlier route through site 02, later possibly shifted to site 03. This does not establish that it changed, when, or in which direction water flowed.",
  "现场记录：路南沟渠汇入这一低点，然后顺低处继续向下游。这是低洼汇水点，不作为穿路涵洞；下游具体受纳点未定。": "Field record: south-side ditches converge in this hollow and continue downhill. This is a low collection point, not a culvert under the road. The receiving point downstream is unknown.",
