  "新增 KMZ 原线 · 旧影像地貌对照": "New original KMZ traces compared with earlier landforms",
  "桥东旧转折同一地理范围；历史画幅另列；三维背景为 2021-09 文件标记": "Same area at the old bend east of the bridge; historical frames are listed separately; 3D background file label: September 2021",
  "2013-09 Google Earth 全区文件标记；未精确复核拍摄日": "Wide Google Earth frame labeled September 2013; the exact acquisition date was not verified",
