  "双湖／自选": "Both lakes / Custom",
  "分区单独显示，仍可手动开图层；返回「双湖／自选」恢复先前自选。西长湖、北小湖、东池与东部泥沼均为独立周边对照，不与主湖合并。北小湖仍为单期参照。东池在时序中显示 N1 固定观测窗的月分类水面；窗内可含分离水斑，面积不计入双湖统计。覆盖不足不显示水面。": "Each area is shown separately. You can still turn on layers manually. Return to Both lakes / Custom to restore your previous selection. West Changhu, North Lakelet, East Pond, and East Marsh are separate comparison sites, not part of the Main Lake. North Lakelet has one reference date. The East Pond timeline shows monthly classified water in the fixed N1 window, which can include disconnected patches. Its area is excluded from the two-lake statistics. Insufficient coverage leaves the water layer blank.",
  "候选汇水试算": "Candidate catchment scenarios",
  "切换西北坡、东池和东部泥沼的 30 米地形对照。 单项试算开启时暂隐主湖分区；关闭即恢复。未指定涵洞通行。": "Compare 30 m terrain scenarios for the Northwest Slope, East Pond and East Marsh. A scenario temporarily hides the Main Lake catchments. The model does not specify culvert passage.",
