  "30 米地表模型推导。2 米线更密，适合放大看走势，不代表高程精确到 2 米，不是测量沟底或水位。": "Derived from a 30 m elevation model. The 2 m interval is denser for close viewing; it does not imply 2 m accuracy or surveyed channel beds or water levels.",
  "密度独立于等高线。箭头表示 30 米地表模型的局部下坡方向；近水平处不绘制，不是水流路径。档位不是 DEM 分辨率。": "Arrow density is independent of contours. Arrows show local downslope direction in the 30 m model, not waterways. Nearly flat ground is left blank. Density settings do not change DEM resolution.",
