  "紫色面：桥西模型汇水范围；青色实线／轮廓：可见形态；蓝色面：注明日期的水类参照；琥珀色虚线：待核连接；×：缺口；◇：跨路标记；●：现场记录的 03 道路四点。现场构造或局地走向不代表已知入湖水路。": "Purple areas: modeled catchments west of the bridge. Solid cyan: visible landforms. Blue areas: dated water classifications. Amber dashes: unverified links. ×: gap. ◇: road crossing. ●: four field sites on Road 03. A visible structure or slope does not establish a route to the lake.",
