  "打开即定位本组，关闭不影响 G332 西坡对照。": "Opening locates these segments. Closing does not affect the G332 west-slope comparison.",
  "青色线：可见田缘／旧横纹；浅绿虚边：影像核查范围；紫色虚边：路西模型搜索窗；紫线：模型段；灰点线：地方道路证据缺口。各段不拼为连续水路，不标流向。": "Cyan: visible field edges and older cross-field traces. Pale green dashes: imagery review areas. Purple dashes: search windows west of the road. Purple lines: model segments. Dotted gray: missing evidence at the local road. No continuous route or flow direction is inferred.",
  "地方道路 Wcross1／2 · G332 西坡试算（可选）": "Local road Wcross1/2 · G332 western slope scenario (optional)",
  "打开即跳到这组位置。Wcross1 原地形、Wcross2 有条件填洼；灰点线标国道证据缺口，不是通水。": "Opening centers the map here. Wcross1 uses the original terrain; Wcross2 uses conditional depression filling. Dotted gray marks evidence gaps on the highway, not flow.",
  "2019-09 用户蓝线 · 原图判读草图": "September 2019 blue traces · Interpretation sketch",
