  "相机位置。选中后的箭头为手机记录朝向，未测量，不代表水流。琥珀色为手机报告误差大于 20 米。": "Camera positions. After selection, the arrow shows the phone’s recorded bearing, not a surveyed direction or water flow. Amber marks phone-reported error above 20 m.",
  "2023 年 7 月 · 三期影像对照窗": "July 2023 · Three-date imagery windows",
  "边框是三期共同有效的 20 米采样格，不是水面。不随月份切换。": "Outlines mark 20 m cells valid on all three dates, not water. They do not change with the selected month.",
  "季节性水文与地貌线索": "Seasonal water and landform clues",
  "青绿：影像可见地貌或判读范围；琥珀：待核；灰点线×：证据缺口；蓝面：标明日期的分类水斑；紫线：地表剖面。均不代表已证流向。": "Teal: visible landforms or review area. Amber: unverified. Dotted gray and ×: evidence gap. Blue areas: dated water classifications. Purple lines: terrain profiles. None establish flow direction.",
