  "本地安全提示：现场原片、缩略图、含相机坐标矢量与内部草图仅留本机，不得随对外分享上传。": "Local-use notice: Keep original field photos, thumbnails, vectors with camera positions and internal sketches on this device. Do not upload them when sharing externally.",
  "左键点击接管鼠标；按住右键或左键拖动转头。WASD 移动，Shift 加速，F 切换步行／飞行；画面上滚轮调速。飞行按 E／空格升、Q／C／Ctrl 降。": "Left-click to capture the mouse. Drag with either button to look around. WASD moves; Shift boosts speed; F switches between walking and flight. Scroll over the scene to adjust speed. In flight, E or Space climbs; Q, C or Ctrl descends.",
  "左键点击接管鼠标；按住右键或左键拖动转头。WASD 移动，Shift 加速，F 切换步行／飞行，画面上滚轮调速。飞行：E 或空格上升，Q、C 或 Ctrl 下降。Esc 先释放鼠标。": "Left-click to capture the mouse. Drag with either button to look around. WASD moves; Shift boosts speed; F switches modes. Scroll to adjust speed. In flight, E or Space climbs; Q, C or Ctrl descends. Esc releases the mouse.",
  "步行视高 1.7 米；切到飞行升至 25 米，飞行默认慢速，最高 8×，水平和升降同档；Shift 临时加速。下方地形倍率只夸张地势，不改变相机视高。30 米地表仅作模拟，不判断道路或设施能否通行。": "Walking eye height is 1.7 m. Flight starts at 25 m and at low speed. The speed setting applies horizontally and vertically, up to 8×; Shift gives a temporary boost. Terrain exaggeration does not change eye height. The 30 m model is for simulation, not for judging access.",
