  "红色宏观 1-1 指向 03 路和主湖西北，1-2 另向偏东；其他红箭头是另外的湖岸方向。它们与路边 KMZ 1–4 编号、金色道路镜头轨迹没有编号关系，不作为测绘水路。": "Sketch arrow 1-1 points toward Road 03 and the northwest shore. Arrow 1-2 turns farther east; other arrows point toward different shores. The sketch numbering does not correspond to KMZ sites 1–4 or the gold camera route. The arrows are not surveyed channels.",
