  "读图口径": "How to read the map",
  "影像可见段只表示地形或地表纹理，看不见的段落保留断口；两条图线接触也不证明同场过水。": "Visible segments represent landforms or surface texture. Unseen sections stay blank. Lines touching on the map do not prove through-flow during the same event.",
  "模型虚线只表示该套地形和计算条件；桥孔、路下连通、流向、水量及改造影响未据此确定。": "Model dashes represent the chosen terrain and assumptions. They do not establish bridge openings, connections below roads, flow direction, discharge or the impact of modifications.",
  "主湖来水｜三处入口与独立线索": "Main Lake inflow · Three possible inlets and independent clues",
  "主湖先看西侧、南中、东南。办公院与地方道路圆涵另看，不从桥东或 03 四点接出一条确定水路。": "Start with West, South-Central and Southeast. The office compound and local round culvert are separate investigations. No confirmed waterway links them to the east side of the bridge or Road 03.",
