  "以东南剖面 B 的 0 m 历史模型锚点为中心、UTM 32650 半径 60 m 内的 22 个原生 JRC 格。三个月均为 22/22 有效观测。": "22 native JRC cells fall within a 60 m radius in UTM 32650 of the historic model anchor at Southeast Profile B, 0 m. All 22 cells are valid in each of three months.",
  "未检出明水仅代表该月分类未检出水体，不等于地面干燥或无来水；像元相邻属于离散分类空间关系，不代表水力连通或入湖通堵。": "No detected open water means only that this month's classification detected none. It does not establish dry ground or absence of inflow. Adjacent classified cells do not establish hydraulic connectivity or whether an inlet is blocked.",
