  "三八水库中桥东口 → 约 717 m 老转折先查是否连通（不画实线），再判断往东池（东北）与往主湖（东南）是否为同一次来水分流。": "From the Sanba Reservoir Bridge east opening, check the roughly 717 m to the old bend before testing whether the northeast route to East Pond and southeast route to Main Lake carry water from the same event. No confirmed line is drawn.",
