  "另一个东南模型停点。三期都没在采样格中辨认出明水，不排除短时浅流。": "Another southeast model endpoint. No open water was visible in the sampled cells on any of the three dates, but brief shallow flow is not ruled out.",
  "办公院附近的影像采样，不是院区边界。实际出口还没有定位。": "An imagery sample near the office compound, not its boundary. The actual outlet is unlocated.",
  "候选入湖位置。7 月 16 日的两个判水格位于岸边明暗过渡，影像不能确认是明水。": "Candidate lake inlet. On 16 July, two cells classified as water lay along a light–dark shoreline transition. The imagery cannot confirm open water.",
  "和桥东的变化方向一致，7 月 16 日地表光谱变化较强，18 日接近此前状态。": "The change matches the east side of the bridge: a stronger spectral change on 16 July and a return toward prior conditions by 18 July.",
  "和桥西变化相近，优先核查桥两侧。影像没有拍到过桥水流。": "Similar change to the west side. Prioritize checks on both sides; imagery does not show water passing under the bridge.",
  "北侧候选过路点的西肩样本。两侧地表变化的幅度不同，北点的过路位置仍待核查。": "Sample at the western shoulder of the northern candidate crossing. The two shoulders changed by different amounts; the crossing remains unverified.",
  "北侧候选过路点的东肩样本。该窗变化比西肩弱。": "Sample at the east shoulder of the northern candidate. Change is weaker than on the west shoulder.",
