  "◇ 定位与地形剖面": "◇ Location and terrain profile",
  "用户指认的办公院定位，在主湖西侧地形模型分区，距最近的旧模型线约 260 米。用此点串联两条地形剖面。": "Field reference for the office compound in the western model area, about 260 m from the nearest earlier model line. It links two terrain profiles.",
