  "📄 来源文件：": "📄 Source file: ",
  "办公院下游 · 模型线重合起点": "Below the office compound · Start of overlapping model paths",
  "这里是办公院地形路径第一次与主湖西侧模型支路重合的位置，距离原地形停点约 67 米。八期影像未辨认出两点间持续可见的沟线。": "This is where the compound model path first overlaps a western Main Lake branch, roughly 67 m from its original-terrain endpoint. No continuously visible channel was identified between them in eight scenes.",
  "先定位办公院真实排水口，再核是否有浅沟接到这一带。": "Locate the actual office compound outlet first, then check whether shallow ditches reach this area.",
  "待核候选": "Unverified candidate",
  "8期 Wayback 日期和 Copernicus / AW3D30 同格核对": "Eight Wayback dates and a same-grid check against Copernicus and AW3D30",
  "约30 m地表剖面，不是现场测量、实测沟槽、入湖水头、水深或湖底；水面参考范围内断线。沿原模型折线，不证明真实水路。": "Terrain sampled at about 30 m resolution, not surveyed channels, water levels, depth or lakebed. Gaps mark reference water areas. The modeled line does not establish a real flow route.",
  "约30 m地表剖面，不是现场测量、实测沟槽、入湖水头、水深或湖底；水面参考范围内断线。沿原模型折线，不证明真实水路。 双源曲线使用原产品高程基准，优先比较沿线起伏。": "Terrain sampled at about 30 m resolution, not a field survey of channels, head, depth or lakebed. Reference water areas remain gaps. The modeled line does not prove flow. The two sources retain their own vertical datums; compare changes along each line.",
