  "道路外侧 45–90 m 宽尺度西高东低；30 m 地表格不能量管底坡度或实测流向。": "Terrain 45–90 m from the road is higher on the west. The 30 m grid does not measure pipe-bed slope or actual flow direction.",
  "与三八水库中桥独立": "Separate from Sanba Reservoir Bridge",
  "距三八水库中桥约 1.57 km；F1 东南模型线交次级路处距圆涵相机约 827–933 m，非同一路线": "The bridge is about 1.57 km away. The F1 southeast model crosses the secondary road about 827–933 m from the culvert camera. They are not the same route.",
