  "缺口 ② LOW-A 停点": "Gap ② LOW-A model endpoint",
  "Copernicus 原地表约 422 m 止于浅洼 LOW-A；四期 20 m 影像前 1 km 未检出水类，中段不补实线": "The unfilled Copernicus path stops at LOW-A after about 422 m. Four 20 m scenes show no classified water along the first 1 km. No solid middle reach is inferred.",
  "分支判断": "Branch assessment",
  "填洼虽趋历史主湖，但经过 / 绕行 LOW-A 随模型变化；当前无稳定可定位分叉，也不连到嘎查办公院": "Depression-filled routes head toward historical Main Lake, but models differ on whether they pass through LOW-A. There is no consistent mapped fork or connection to the office compound.",
  "单独核查圆涵两端实际洞口与相邻边沟，确认东口是否接上旧模型首格附近的低带。": "Check both actual culvert openings and roadside ditches, especially whether the east opening reaches the low corridor near the first archived model cell.",
  "独立查看约 422 m 处浅洼 LOW-A 前后是否有连续水迹、侧溢或旁路；两处缺口接上前不延画入湖实线。": "Check for continuous traces, spills or bypasses around LOW-A, about 422 m away. Do not extend a solid line to the lake across either unverified gap.",
