  "同天 Sentinel-2 窄裁片仅覆盖主湖，不含三八水库中桥、老转折窗口与东北/东南纹理末端，已禁用于桥后支路卡片。": "The same-day Sentinel-2 crop covers only the main lake. It excludes Sanba Reservoir Bridge, the old bend window and the ends of the northeast and southeast traces, so it is not offered for the downstream branch cards.",
  "南部环岛": "South roundabout",
  "调查位置 · 各段留空": "Survey sites · Gaps left unconnected",
