  "查看上游、中桥和三条下游线索，同时保留主湖三个原分区。": "See the upstream area, bridge and three downstream clues together, with the Main Lake’s three original subcatchments.",
  "显示外坡大沟壑和中桥西侧两个候选汇水面，分别止于桥西的观察断面。仅显示两套 30 米地形、各三处断面共同支持的范围，未合并成一个过桥流域。": "Two candidate catchments, at the outer ravine and west of the bridge, end at separate observation sections. Only areas supported by both 30 m elevation models and their three sections are shown; they are not merged into one catchment crossing the bridge.",
  "各个西北坡观察点是独立终点，不能相加。桥西近岸没有双模型共同命中的上游格，图上不画跨桥连线。": "Each northwest-slope observation point is an independent outlet; their areas cannot be added. The models agree on no upstream cells at the near bank west of the bridge, so no cross-bridge connection is drawn.",
  "东池共同命中的陆侧来水候选仅 20 格（0.018 km²），不含东池终点本身。": "The two models agree on only 20 candidate land cells draining toward East Pond (0.018 km²), not counting the pond outlet reference itself.",
  "只把东池作为东侧收水终点，两套地形模型重合 7.8759 km²。计算中让局部低点达到可外溢的高程，不是填土、开挖或施工方案。": "With East Pond as the only eastern receiving area, the two terrain models overlap across 7.8759 km². The calculation raises local depressions to their spill elevations; it does not propose fill, excavation or construction.",
  "把东池和三处泥沼分别作为收水终点，水在模型里到先遇到的终点就停止追踪。重新计算后东池重合 1.0386 km²。这是终点设定带来的差异，不是实测分流。": "East Pond and three marsh depressions are separate receiving areas. The model stops tracing flow at the first one it reaches. In this run the models overlap across 1.0386 km² for East Pond. The difference reflects the model setup, not a measured split in flow.",
  "东池 · 不单列泥沼拦蓄": "East Pond · Marsh depressions not treated as separate receiving areas",
  "03 四点": "Road 03 · Four sites",
  "由西北高处看向东南，用于辨认全区地貌背景。": "Look southeast from higher ground in the northwest to see the overall terrain.",
