  "独立可辨段和当前关注位置": "Separate identifiable segments and the current focus",
  "已见末端 / 独立段起点": "Visible endpoint / start of the separate segment",
  "找同一处弯折。NASA POWER 区域月降水：2015 年 7 月 76.32 mm，2021 年 7 月 170.09 mm。两张影像只有月份，不能把整月雨量当成拍摄前雨量，也不能由色差判断沟里有水。": "Compare the same bend. NASA POWER regional monthly precipitation was 76.32 mm in July 2015 and 170.09 mm in July 2021. Only the image months are known. Monthly rainfall does not establish how much fell before capture, and color differences do not establish water in the ditch.",
  "桥西上游：": "Upstream, west of the bridge: ",
  "灰蓝面是两处候选范围，未合并。": "The two blue-gray candidate areas are shown separately.",
  "桥后线索：": "Downstream clues: ",
  "01–04 与主湖西北岸、东侧泥沼与东池、西长湖（独立候选）。青绿实线是可辨沟形，琥珀虚线是原标绘，紫虚线是条件推演，缺口留空。": "Sites 01–04 and the northwest shore of Main Lake; East Marsh and East Pond; and West Changhu as an independent candidate. Solid teal shows visible ditch traces, dashed amber shows the original mapping, and dashed purple shows modeled paths. Gaps remain open.",
  "主湖分区：": "Main Lake subcatchments: ",
  "金色面保留 E18、南中 C、东南 B。白色点线为与 E18 叠置的沟段；E18 边界和面积不变。": "Gold shows E18, South-Central C and Southeast B. The dotted white line marks the ditch segment that overlaps E18; the E18 boundary and area are unchanged.",
