  "保留原始KML WGS84坐标及绘制顺序，不加连线；高程0不作为地表高程。此线不是测得流量或已证实连通。": "The original KML coordinates (WGS84) and drawing order are preserved, with no lines added. A zero elevation in the file is not ground elevation. The trace does not measure discharge or establish connectivity.",
  "当前镜头线路和前方定位，不是水路": "Camera path and upcoming location, not a waterway",
  "主湖历史参考水面": "Historical Main Lake reference extent",
  "历史主湖主体": "Historical Main Lake basin",
  "院边旧弯形暗带仍可辨，向道路方向另见短痕。": "The old curved dark band is still visible at the compound edge. A separate short trace lies toward the road.",
  "院边出现较宽的浅色平整地，旧弯带和第 2 点北面的旧痕大部不再清楚；不能由影像认定管口被填。": "A wider, light-colored graded area appears along the compound. Much of the former bend and the trace north of Site 02 are no longer distinct. The image does not establish that the pipe opening was filled.",
  "第 2 点北侧新出入口西边见较窄暗痕；路南另有短痕，隔路的两段不能连成一条已知水路。": "A narrow dark trace is visible west of a new access north of Site 02. Another short trace lies south of the road. Together they do not establish a continuous waterway.",
  "第 3 点北侧，沿院落东边的暗痕到达道路附近；南侧路缘有较明显短痕。": "North of Site 03, the dark trace along the compound’s east side approaches the road. A short trace is relatively clear on the south shoulder.",
  "第 3 点北侧暗痕靠路终点看得较清，路南短痕较弱。两期的两侧地表沟痕与现场记录相对照，不表示卫星拍到了涵管、水流方向或同期过水。": "The northern trace near Site 03 is clearer where it ends by the road, while the short southern trace is faint. Surface traces from both dates can be compared with field records. The images do not show a culvert, flow direction or water passing at the time.",
  "沿本条模型线的原始顶点顺序，从首点 0 m 到该模型线终点；不是实测流向。": "Distance follows the model line’s original vertex order from 0 m to the end. It is not a measured flow direction.",
